{"id":"dd4ed6b174815eef","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-degree.md","title":"Degree","display":"df-degree — Degree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-degree","aliases":["58-df-degree"],"display":"df-degree — Degree","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-degree — Degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" href=\"?note=ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md\">../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,p,d\\in V\">\\(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,p,d\\in V\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\">\\(\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" href=\"?note=ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md\">../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle i\\rangle\">\\(\\langle i\\rangle\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^1\">\\(\\mathbb N^1\\)</span> 中唯一满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle i\\rangle(0)=i\">\\(\\langle i\\rangle(0)=i\\)</span> 的一元指数元组</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UnivariatePolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{UnivariatePolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>（本文件定义的一元多项式次数关系）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnivariatePolynomialDegree}_S(d,p,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d,p,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnivariatePolynomialDegree}_S(d,p,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d,p,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}degree\\text{-}univariate\\text{-}support}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnivariatePolynomialDegree}_S(d,p,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(p,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(p(\\langle i\\rangle)\\neq0_R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land d=\\max\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:p(\\langle i\\rangle)\\neq0_R\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}degree\\text{-}univariate\\text{-}support}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnivariatePolynomialDegree}_S(d,p,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(p,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(p(\\langle i\\rangle)\\neq0_R\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land d=\\max\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:p(\\langle i\\rangle)\\neq0_R\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Degree is the largest exponent with nonzero coefficient; the zero polynomial is deliberately excluded because its degree requires a separate convention.</li>\n<li>Under the upstream encoding a univariate polynomial has domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^1\">\\(\\mathbb N^1\\)</span>, not <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>.  Thus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(\\langle i\\rangle)\">\\(p(\\langle i\\rangle)\\)</span> is coefficient lookup; evaluation at a scalar is the separate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S\\)</span> relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S\\subseteq V^7$ 与 $\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^8$（see [[../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,p,d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle i\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle i\\rangle(0)=i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UnivariatePolynomialDegree}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnivariatePolynomialDegree}_S(d,p,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PolynomialDegree}_S(d,p,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}degree\\text{-}univariate\\text{-}support}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UnivariatePolynomialDegree}_S(d,p,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Polynomial}_S(p,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,1)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(p(\\langle i\\rangle)\\neq0_R\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land d=\\max\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:p(\\langle i\\rangle)\\neq0_R\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb N^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"p(\\langle i\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolynomialEvaluation}_S","display":false}],"bytes":1634,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-402","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-degree.md|58-df-degree]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["ab5e359a8ea0dcb4"]}